:{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-05T22:26:42Z","updated_at":"2024-12-05T22:26:42Z","body":"Fixed the mistake.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2521595017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523572853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100046#issuecomment-2523572853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100046","id":2523572853,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Waqp1","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T15:59:54Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T15:59:54Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\nThere definitely seems to be a bug here, but I'm not sure this is the right fix.\r\n\r\nThe first instance binding is special for classes that are defined in a GDExtension, which is why `set_instance_binding()` and `clear_internal_extension()` treat it the way they do for reloading. But there may be additional instance bindings after the first one that we don't want to lose track of.\r\n\r\nFor example, let's say a class is defined in GDExtension (so that's the first instance binding) and the developer also used it in C# (which would be the second instance binding) and a reload has happened, which clears out the first binding. So, if `set_instance_binding()` just changes the count to `1`, then we'll effectively forget about the C# instance binding.\r\n\r\nI think maybe the bug is actually in `free_instance_binding()` not treating the first binding as special for GDExtension-defined classes? (FYI, for classes that aren't defined in GDExtension, the first binding isn't special.) Maybe we need to check if this is a GDExtension-defined class, and clear out the first instance binding (if it matches the token), but not move the other bindings up in the list?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523572853/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]